OL,3,GNEWSABusy crossroads closed overnight
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA busy crossroads in Leicester was
OL,7,Fclosed overnight after a crash
OL,8,Finvolving a lorry and a car.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fwas called to the junction of Uppingham
OL,12,FRoad and Goodwood Road at about 22:15
OL,13,FBST on Wednesday.
OL,15,FA rescue crew and hazardous materials
OL,16,Funit attended the scene.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
