OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the fire service
OL,7,Fsaid: "One casualty was extricated from
OL,8,Ftheir vehicle by [East Midlands
OL,9,FAmbulance Service] staff before our
OL,10,Fcrews' arrival and was taken to
OL,11,Fhospital."
